# Unity compile status (agent gate)

Grid Dungeon game repo uses [`com.miraluna.editor-agent-compile`](../../com.miraluna.editor-agent-compile) for structured compile checks while the Editor stays open.

Authority: [griddungeon-game Tools/README.md](../../griddungeon-game/Tools/README.md).

## When to run (agents)

After any handoff-touching **`.cs`** change when the Unity Editor **may be open** on `griddungeon-game`:

```powershell
cd <griddungeon-game>
.\Tools\request-compile-status.ps1
```

- Exit **0** required before claiming compile-clean or closing a C# ticket.
- Exit **1** — fix reported `CS####` lines; re-run until green.
- Do **not** run `Tools/ci-compile.ps1` while the Editor has this project open.

## Fallbacks

| Situation | Command |
|-----------|---------|
| Read last JSON without triggering compile | `.\Tools\read-compile-status.ps1` |
| Package/JSON unavailable | `.\Tools\read-unity-editor-log.ps1` |
| Editor closed | `.\Tools\ci-compile.ps1` |

See `griddungeon-game/.cursor/rules/unity-compile-status-agent.mdc` for full detail.
